<title>AUSTRALIA: Walker to raise A$19.74 mln in share issue.</title>
<headline>Walker to raise A$19.74 mln in share issue.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property group Walker Corp Ltd said on Friday it planned to raise A$19.74 million through the issue of 23.5 million shares at 84 cents each.</p>
<p>Walker Corp said funds from the issue would be used for working capital for the acquisition and development of residential and industrial sites. Walker Corp shares were five cents higher at 93 cents at 10.20 a.m. (0020 GMT).</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
